                    <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Removal of pharmaceuticals and personal care products using constructed wetlands: effective plant-bacteria synergism may enhance degradation efficiency</h1>

                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers">
                        
        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item" data-test="article-category">Review Article</li>
    
    

                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
                            Published: <time datetime="2019-05-27">27 May 2019</time>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
